    "text": "Gridley Herald\nwebsite\nGridley\nWe Need You to Help Us Score!\n9 hours ago\nGRIDLEY, CA (MPG) – With an overwhelming number of applicants, Gridley Parks and Recreation is recruiting additional soccer coaches for the upcoming fall season. To facilitate the number of interested children, Gridley Parks and Recreation Director Amanda Kaelin said that she still needs coaches for both girl’s 10U and boy’s 10U teams, and ideally, an additional coach for the 12-14U boys age bracket.",
